### ===================================================================
### MAIN BACKEND & DATABASE HEALTH CHECK TESTS
### Use with VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP Client
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json 

### 1. Check Main Backend & PostgreSQL Database Health
# Expected: 200 OK, database: { connected: true }
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2. Check 404 Not Found Middleware
# Expected: 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/non-existing-route
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
